## narra (Pons v2 / Robinhood Chain metas)

- `narra now --json` — which metas are live (HOT / EMERGING / ROTATING / COOLING / DEAD).
- `narra coin <CA> --json` — run this first for any 0x address; verdict IN / EDGE / OUT / ORPHAN / NOT_PONS with `reasons[]`.
- `narra flow --json`, `narra why <slug> --json`, `narra doctor --json`.
- Read-only tool. IN is membership in a live meta, never a buy signal. Quote reasons verbatim. Never suggest entering OUT/ORPHAN tokens or DEAD/COOLING clusters.
- MCP alternative: `{ "mcpServers": { "narra": { "command": "npx", "args": ["-y", "narrahood", "mcp"] } } }`
